<!--Post: 6179--><!--Time: 1107565834-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6179"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 5:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK has increased his frequency of communications drasticly.  What if...We, the media, and LE just ignore him?  He will not kill again and if he does he is toast...But he could be forced into making a fatal mistake when the lime-light is suddenly turned off for no apparent reason....Because after all he wants the attention he is getting finally.  Thoughts?   <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6179-->
<!--Post: 6187--><!--Time: 1107569308-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6187"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brady<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brady<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 6:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->As fun as that sounds, it won&#39;t happen.  BTK was silent for a long time - something/someone kept him busy.  I think the more &#34;drops&#34; or communications he makes the closer we are to finding out who this nut case is.  Forensics are light years ahead of where they were in 1974.  He&#39;ll trip up soon.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6187-->
<!--Post: 6199--><!--Time: 1107574689-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6199"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Msrusty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Msrusty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 7:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m thinking LE might think if they ignored him he might kill again. I think at this point he only wants the attention that&#39;s being focused on him.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6199-->
<!--Post: 6207--><!--Time: 1107579500-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6207"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Newyorker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Newyorker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 8:58 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I believe that he is slowly dropping clues that would lead to him being dead. I don&#39; tknow why I just have this sick feeling.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6207-->
<!--Post: 6229--><!--Time: 1107607018-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6229"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 4:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I wonder if BTK was planning on committing suicide?   If he&#39;s too over-the-hill to kill anymore, and he hasn&#39;t got anything else going on in his life to give him any thrills or to feed his ego, maybe he just decided he&#39;d end it all.  But first, he&#39;d get rid of all his crime trophies and taunt the police and the public one last time.  If he got rid of all his trophies &#40;all the evidence linking him to the crimes in other words&#41; and then died, he could disappear like a phantom -- build up his legend, and then vanish in a puff of smoke like Jack the Ripper or somebody.   <BR> <BR>Except now that he&#39;s been indulging himself with all these communications, and the police are still no closer to catching him, maybe he&#39;s really enjoying this.  Enjoying it -- too much to commit suicide just yet. <BR> <BR>A wild theory! <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6229-->
<!--Post: 6233--><!--Time: 1107623189-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6233"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Newyorker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Newyorker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 9:06 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hmm... Audreyamw, I have another theory. I think that he will tell KAKE or WPD where another communication is and they would try and find it and notice that there is a dead body and it is him with a note saying I AM BTK. I don&#39;t know just a sick theory of mine. I saw it in a movie lol. Sort of like in the movie The Saw, he was acting dead all along in the middle of the bathroom.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6233-->
<!--Post: 6237--><!--Time: 1107625525-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6237"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Blade<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Blade<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 9:45 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think that he will bite the bullet as law enforcement closes in.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6237-->
<!--Post: 6247--><!--Time: 1107631290-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6247"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 05, 2005 - 11:21 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have to disagree with Brady - There is nothing to suggest that he will &#34;trip up&#34;. He has not made any mistakes up to this point and he probably will not. Some of these posts make it sound like, just because he&#39;s older now, he doesn&#39;t understand LE&#39;s forensic capabilities. If he was keen on investigayion techniques and procedures in the 70&#39;s, you can bet he knows just as much, if not more, about the advances. <BR> <BR>This guy could have been caught decades ago if LE had released more to the public. Letters &#40;within reason&#41;, clues, drops, and especially drawings. Everything except what is necessary to authenticate true BTK communications. There were/are people in the area that would recognize something about the communications and id him. <BR> <BR>Just my opinion. <BR> <BR>iq<!--/Text--></td></tr>
