<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6602"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nm_pi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nm_pi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 08, 2005 - 3:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Blade: Ive done some research on the topic myself &#60;smirk&#62;. Ive found some characters on the national services. Makes me wonder if he &#34;ordered in&#34; using the internet....<!--/Text--></td></tr>
