<!--Post: 9417--><!--Time: 1109508081-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9417"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brady<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brady<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 4:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Regarding this thread, in a way it appears as if he was ignored - at least by LE anyway.  I completely understand why they didn&#39;t release some of the stuff  over the last 30 years, but it seems aparent now that using the public&#39;s help brought this to an end.  It certainly created a lot of &#34;buzz&#34; and, if it&#39;s true that his daughter turned him in, then it worked.  As I said in the second post, he would trip up soon.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9417-->
<!--Post: 9844--><!--Time: 1109659090-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9844"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doom<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doom<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 10:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks Brady it is a tactic to keep the perp communicating and the more an unsub communicates the more likely he or she will be caught.  He in this case.  The chief has confirmed that was the tactic used to keep him writing. It has been reported his daughter turned him in but she did not she was asked by LE to provide DNA. I am sure it will come out soon but it involves a computer disc BTK sent to LE. <BR> <BR>Doom <!--/Text--></td></tr>
