<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9917"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whatthehell<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whatthehell<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 11:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Posted on Sunday, February 20, 2005 - 10:37 pm:      <BR>This was my original post on BTK <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR>HERE IS MY PERSONAL THEORY, FEEL FREE TO PICK IT APART OR SUPPORT IT. I BASE IT ON WHAT WE HAVE BEEN GIVEN AS FACT. SHOULD OTHER CASES BE CREDITED TO BTK OR OTHER INFO. BECOME AVAILABLE IT MAY NOT HOLD WATER, BUT WITH WHAT WE KNOW NOW I BELIEVE IT TO BE WORTH CONSIDERING.  <BR> <BR>FIRST OFF THE FIRST KILLINGS WITH THE OTERO FAMILY IS BY DEFINITION A MASS MURDER. THE SECOND KILLING WITH THE BRIGHTS WAS AN ATTEMPTED MASSMURDER. &#34;A KILLER IS BORN&#34;  <BR> <BR>I BELIEVE THAT BTK HAS A COLEMAN CONNECTION. A VERY STRONG ONE. THE KILLING OF JULIE OTERO WAS IN MY OPINION A GRUDGE KILLING. I THINK THAT EITHER A SEXUAL ADVANCE REJECTED, ROMANCE GONE BAD OR DRUGS INVOLVED. WHAT EVER I THINK THERE WAS A CONNECTION AND IT WENT WRONG. HE WENT TO KILL JULIE AND MAYBE JOSEPH ALSO BUT NEVER THE KIDS. HE DID NOT PLAN ON THEM BEING HOME.  <BR> <BR>I ALSO THINK THAT THE SHOOTING/ATTEMPTED ROBBERY OF MICHEAL WILLIAMS COULD HAVE BEEN ASSOCIATED BUT EVEN IF IT WAS F YOU KNOW HE WAS THE LINE SUPERVISOR OF THE COLEMAN LINE WHERE JULIE WORKED.  <BR> <BR>LESS THEN THREE MONTHS LATER KATHRYN BRIGHT IS KILLED. SHE ALSO WORKED AT COLEMAN ON THE SAME LINE. I DO NOT KNOW HOW MANY PEOPLE WORKED AT COLEMAN OR ON THAT LINE IN THE FIRST 4 MONTHS OF 1974. BUT EVEN IF IT WAS 100, IF TWO OF THEM WERE KILLED AND THE FOREMAN WAS SHOT ALL IN THE SAME PERIOD OF FOUR MONTHS I WOULD HAVE TO SAY THAT IS A STATISTICAL ODDITY.  <BR> <BR>MY THOERY IS THAT THE OTERO KILLING A GRUDGE KILLING. THE BRIGHT KILLING WAS EITHER AN ASSOCIATED GRUDGE KILLING OR &#34;SHE KNEW TOO MUCH&#34; KILLING.  <BR> <BR>HERE IS WHERE I THINK THAT BTK STARTED TO LIKE THE KILLING AND THE SEXUAL RELEASE IT OFFERED.  <BR> <BR>HE DOES NOT HAVE TO KILL, BUT HE IS LEARNING TO LIKE IT. THREE YEARS WITHOUT ANOTHER KILL. MAYBE IN A RELATIONSHIP? MAYBE NOT REJECTED OR SCORNED ENOUGH TO SET OFF THE MONSTER THAT IS IN HIM NOW.  <BR> <BR>PERHAPS SHIRLEY VIAN REJECTED HIM AT THIS POINT. NOT BEING A TRU SERIAL KILLER HE DOES NOT NEED TO KILL BUT WANTS TO KILL HER FOR THE REJECTION, ETC.  <BR> <BR>ANOTHER NINE MONTHS GO BY BEFORE THE MONSTER IS SUMMOND TO KILL NANCY FOX.  <BR> <BR>UNLIKE MOST SERIAL KILLERS BTK IS NOT KILLING TRANSIENTS AND HOOKERS. HE IS COMMUNICATING WITH MEDIA AND AND LE AND NOT FEELING ANY THREAT OF BEING CAUGHT. BY DEFINITIONS HE IS NOT FOLLOWING SERIAL KILLER PATTERNS. SO FAR HE HAS STABBED, SHOT, STRANGLED AND SUFFERACATED VICTIMS. HIS ONLY SET PATTERN SO FAR IS THE TUESDAY AND THURSDAY KILLING DAYS. PHONE LINES BEING CUT DOES NOT EVEN STAY TRUE BECAUSE OF THE KIDS BEING SAVED BY THE RINGING PHONE.  <BR> <BR>1 YEAR AND FOUR MONTHS LATER THE WILLIAMS LETTER IS SENT. EVERONE INVOLVED THAT THE TRUE TARGET WAS THE ELDERLY WOMANS DAUGHTER. 1 YEAR AND FOUR MONTHS WITHOUT KILLING. NOT TRUE TO FORM FOR A SERIAL KILLER. ONCE AGAIN REJECTION WAKED THE MONSTER.  <BR> <BR>THE TIME BETWEEN THE KILLINGS GETS LONGER EACH TIME. MAYBE HE IS HAVING LUCK WITH THE LADIES DURING THIS TIME. HE MAY EVEN BE IN RELATIONSHIPS DURING THESE PERIODS.  <BR> <BR>ALMOST NINE YEARS WITHOUT A CLAIMED KILLING AND OVER 7 WITHOUT A CLAIMED ATTEMPT. THEN VICKI WEGERLE.  <BR> <BR>WHAT THE HELL!!!!!!!  <BR>WHY NOW? THE GROUP KNOWN AS THE GHOST BUSTERS IS ACTIVLY WORKING THE CASE. THEY ARE USING NEW TECH., DNA TESTING, COMPUTER DATABASES AND PSYCHOLOGICAL PROFILES. DAMN, THIS WOULD SURE MAKE A GUY THAT IS LYING LOW AND THINKING HE HAS GOTTEN BY WITH MURDER A LITTLE NERVOUS. THUS HE KILLS VICKI AS DISTRACTION. HOW IS THIS A DISTRACTION? IT MAY HAVE BEEN ANOTHER KILLING IN THE SAME MODE OR DUE TO THE GEOGRAPIC LOCATION A DISTRACTION FROM HIS &#34;COMFORT ZONE/KILLING FIELD&#34;.  <BR> <BR>ALL THE OTHER KILLINGS, H.R. BUILDING, THE PHONE BOOTH THAT THE FOX CALL WAS MADE FROM, ALL IN A LITTLE &#34;NEST&#34; AROUND DOUGLAS AND HILLSIDE. I THINK THIS IS HIS COMFORT ZONE. HIS KILLING FIELD AND PROBABLY HIS HOME NEIGHBORHOOD. THE WEGERLE KILLING COULD HAVE JUST BEEN A DISTRACTION FROM THIS ZONE.  <BR>EVEN TODAY, MURDOCK PARK WHERE THE PACKAGE WAS FOUND, THE C STORE WHER HE PLACED THE CALL TO TELL ABOUT THE FOX PACKAGE, ALL IN THIS &#34;NEST&#34;.  <BR>EVENT HE WILLIAMS ATTEMPT IS IN THIS NEST.  <BR> <BR>I BELIEVE THAT HE WAS A SETTLED MAN AFTER THE WILLIAMS ATTEMPT AND THE WEGERLE KILLING WAS EITHER A DISTRACTION OR A BRIEF BACKSLIDE.  <BR> <BR>THE BTK KILLER HAS NEVER LEFT WICHITA. HE HAS NOT BEEN IN JAIL AND HE HAS NOT BEEN HOSPITALIZED. HE HAS BEEN LIVING RIGHT THER AMONG THE GOOD PEOPLE OF SEDWICK COUNTY. HE PROBABLY HAS OR MOST LIKELY HAD A WIFE. SHE MAY HAVE RECENTLY DIED. THUS HIS NEW COMMUNICATIONS AND ACTIVITY. HE STOPPED KILLING BECAUSE HE IS NOT A REAL SERIAL KILLER. HE IS THE GUY NEXT DOOR. WHEN HIS IDENTITY IS KNOWN, WE WILL ALL BEING GOING, &#39;HOLY CRAP IT WAS HIM&#34;. HE IS SOMEONE THAT WALKS THE STREETS OF WICHITA EVERYDAY. HE DID/DOES HOLD A JOB. HE PROBABL HAS A MORTGAGE AND A RETIRMENT PLAN AND PROBABLY ONE FRIEND THAT WHEN IT IS ALL OVER WILL SAY &#39;DAMN I HAVE KNOWN THAT GUY FOR TWNETY FIVE YEARS&#34;  <BR> <BR>DO NOT GET ME WRONG BTK IS A SICK MAN. HE HAS A TASTE FOR KILLING AND HAS THE MENTAL AD EMOTIONAL CAPACITY TO KILL AGAIN IF NPT THE PHYSICAL. HE IS A VERY SMART MAN. HOWEVER NOT AS SMART AS WE ALL GIVE HIM CREDIT FOR. MIS INFORMATION AND AFTER THE FACT MODERATION DO NOT MAKE A GENIUS.  <BR> <BR>LE IS CLOSE. THEY HOLD ALOT BACK IN HOPES OF NOT HAVING TO PICK UP ANOTHER BODY. THEY WANT THE COMMUNICATION TO STAY OPEN SO THE SAVE VALIDATION INF FROM US SO THAT NOT EVERY NUT JOB IN THE MIDWEST STARTS SENDING IN STUFF.  <BR> <BR>HE MAY BE ON HIS DEATH BED. HIS WIFE/LOVER WHATEVER MAY HAVE RECENTLY DIED OR BEEN REMOVED FROM THE PICTURE, EITHER WAY HIS MIND IS SPINNING AND HE NEED TO GET SOME OF THIS OFF HIS CHEST. THUS THE GAME. WE ARE CLOSE TO THE END OF THAT GAME. I DO NOT THINK THERE WILL BE ANYMORE KILLING AND I THINK THAT WE WILL KNOW WHO BTK IS REAL SOON. MAYBE BY THE END OF SUMMER.  <BR> <BR>CHECK MY DATES, CHECK THE MAP OF THE KILLINGS AND ASSOCIATED LOCATIONS. CHECK THE COLEMAN CONNECTION. HELL THROW IN THE DMV, BLACKOUT CONNECTIONS ALSO IT STILL FITS. THE BLACK OUT IS NOT FAR AWAY FRO THE &#34;NEST&#39; AND A BULIDING THAT USED TO BE A STATE BUILDING SITS AT HILLSIDE AND DOUGLAS.  <BR> <BR>PLEASE FEEL FREE TO SUPPORT OR DISAGREE. IT IS ONLY ONE MANS THEORY. I DO LOOK FORWARD TO THE FEEDBACK. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
