<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10080"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Foxfire<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Foxfire<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 9:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think a lot of his killings DID have to do with a grudge, real or imagined.  It seems that he was not picking people at random really at all.  There was something that triggered it in advance where he would either work around them or run into them under some other &#34;normal&#34; circumstances.   <BR> <BR>Then at the very least, he felt a sort of &#34;attraction&#34; for a few of the women but it was translated into how great it would be to &#34;btk&#34; them. <BR> <BR>Julie and Katherine were both either around him at work even in the lunch area or something like that or he knew them through somebody else who still worked at Coleman&#39;s when and after he quit or was laid off, I think. <BR> <BR>However, he seemed to have WAY too much enjoyment out of killing poor sweet little Josephine which is so terribly horrible and odd since there are no more reports at least yet of him having been inappropriate with children in any way in his regular life.  Usually pedafiles just CANNOT stop from transferring it into their daily activities. <BR> <BR>If he shot Michael Williams, and it seems likely to me at least that he did, THAT may have been a REAL grudge type of crime originally for maybe having something to do with him losing his job.  After he did that, it felt &#34;GOOD&#34; in a twisted, satisfying way.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
